<%- include('partials/header') %>
<header class="subnav">
  <div class="subnav-inner"><h1 class="subnav-title">연동 설정</h1></div>
</header>

<main class="container narrow stack">
  <section>
    <p class="section-label">구글 · 캘린더와 메일</p>
    <div class="group" id="google-card">
      <div class="setting-row">
        <span class="icon-tile" style="background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--hairline)">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" aria-hidden="true"><path fill="#4285F4" d="M21.6 12.2c0-.7-.1-1.4-.2-2H12v3.8h5.4a4.6 4.6 0 0 1-2 3v2.5h3.2c1.9-1.7 3-4.3 3-7.3z"/><path fill="#34A853" d="M12 22c2.7 0 5-.9 6.6-2.4l-3.2-2.5c-.9.6-2 1-3.4 1-2.6 0-4.8-1.8-5.6-4.1H3.1v2.6A10 10 0 0 0 12 22z"/><path fill="#FBBC05" d="M6.4 14c-.2-.6-.3-1.3-.3-2s.1-1.4.3-2V7.4H3.1a10 10 0 0 0 0 9.2z"/><path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 5.9c1.5 0 2.8.5 3.8 1.5l2.8-2.8A10 10 0 0 0 3.1 7.4L6.4 10c.8-2.3 3-4.1 5.6-4.1z"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="row-main">
          <div class="row-title">구글 계정</div>
          <div class="row-sub" id="g-status"><span class="skel" style="width: 160px"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-end" id="g-actions"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="setting-row hidden" id="g-detail">
        <div class="row-main">
          <div class="row-sub" style="margin: 0"><span>권한</span><span class="scope-list" id="g-scopes"></span></div>
          <div class="row-sub" id="g-sync"></div>
        </div>
        <button class="btn sm secondary" id="g-sync-now"><svg class="i sm"><use href="#i-sync"/></svg>지금 동기화</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="section-foot">테스트 버전 앱이라 7일마다 다시 연결이 필요할 수 있어요. 발표 전날 한 번 다시 연결해 두세요.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="section-label">노션 · 할 일 내보내기</p>
    <form class="group" id="notion-form">
      <div class="setting-row">
        <span class="icon-tile ink"><b style="font-size: 15px; font-family: Georgia, serif">N</b></span>
        <div class="row-main">
          <div class="row-title">노션</div>
          <div class="row-sub" id="n-status"><span class="skel" style="width: 120px"></span></div>
        </div>
        <div class="row-end" id="n-actions"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="setting-form">
        <div class="field"><label for="n-token">Integration 토큰</label><input id="n-token" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="secret_… 또는 ntn_…" /></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="n-db">내보낼 데이터베이스 ID</label><input id="n-db" autocomplete="off" placeholder="32자리 ID" />
          <p class="fine" style="margin: 6px 4px 0">노션 데이터베이스 페이지 주소의 <b>?v=</b> 앞 32자리예요. 데이터베이스에서 ··· → 연결 → 내 integration을 추가해야 해요.</p></div>
        <div class="live-foot"><span class="fine">토큰은 서버에만 저장되고 화면에 다시 보이지 않아요</span><button class="btn sm">저장</button></div>
      </div>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section>
    <p class="section-label">음성</p>
    <div class="group">
      <div class="setting-row">
        <span class="icon-tile"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-mic"/></svg></span>
        <div class="row-main"><div class="row-title">음성 인식</div><div class="row-sub" id="stt-status"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="setting-row">
        <span class="icon-tile gray"><svg class="i"><use href="#i-speaker"/></svg></span>
        <div class="row-main"><div class="row-title">브리핑 읽어주기</div><div class="row-sub" id="tts-status"></div></div>
        <button class="btn sm gray" id="tts-test">미리 듣기</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
<script src="/js/settings.js" defer></script>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
